upleft-markup
=============

upleft-markup is a Rust port of parts of swift-markdown
(https://github.com/apple/swift-markdown), at revision
27b7fc1a19068bcea3d2072db0ce86360d1400ed:

    swift-markdown, Copyright (c) 2021 Apple Inc. and the Swift project authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 with Runtime Library Exception

The ported files keep that license. See LICENSE for the full text.

Modifications: the Swift sources were translated to Rust for Upleft
(https://github.com/bitemyapp/upleft). The translation keeps swift-markdown's
algorithms and observable behaviour; only the in-memory representation of the
markup tree differs.
